extends Level
## "Полигон": a level several screens wide for the co-op rules — the camera
## zooming out and holding heroes back, falls into pits, respawning next to the
## partner and at checkpoints. F2 opens the test room.
## Left to right: start + checkpoint, a pit, stairs up to a plateau with a
## checkpoint, a wide pit with a stepping stone, an arena with ledges, a final checkpoint.

## 100 x 22 tiles (legend in Level).
